  m_Name: case_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseData
  id: 3
  context: "THE THEFT OF EXAM SUBJECTS, JEAN-JAUR\xC8S SCHOOL\nOn Thursday, the subjects
    from the final mathematics test for ninth grade classes disappeared from the
    secretariat\u2019s vault between 5:30 p.m. and 7:30 p.m. The chest was opened
    with the key, without breaking in. Someone then photocopied the subjects, which
    are already circulating on a student messaging group. The director, Mrs. Lacombe,
    demands the culprit before the next day\u2019s exam at 8 a.m. Ten adults from
    the institution were still present after the end of classes."
  facts: "End of classes: 5:30 p.m. \nSecretariat locked at 5:45 p.m. \nBadge no.
    12 (staff) used on the door to corridor B at 6:42 p.m. \nThe photocopier in the
    corridor printed 24 pages at 6:50 p.m. \nA coffee stain on the first page of
    the photocopy and a student saw a blue vest silhouette in the courtyard\nThewindow
    in corridor B remained ajar"
  suspects:
